{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Solace of Flowers",
    "steam_appid": 3577070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/6c726ca386925d70473422c243d71d5e.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/5400818dd9b889fe10620e2c4e88a492.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/2244daca41b52aa058e8e2ec4fd9ecba.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/6c726ca386925d70473422c243d71d5e.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/5400818dd9b889fe10620e2c4e88a492.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/2244daca41b52aa058e8e2ec4fd9ecba.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Solace of Flowers is a card game where flowers are used to restore life in a dying world. Build and improve your deck and use it to cover the corrupted areas of the world with vegetation before the damage to the environment becomes irreversible.",
